":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/885-bwgustaf","name":"bwgustaf","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-20T16:34:28-08:00","id":14957,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackhatmatt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/12069-inspirational-music-for-demon?p=14730#post14730\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One of my favorite <b>Demon</b> songs: &quot;<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gH2efAcmBQM\" target=\"_blank\">Sail</a>&quot; by AWOLNATION.</div> </div> </div> </div>Conveniently enough, I just added this song to my playlist shortly before the Kickstarter launched, when I was looking to expand my trip-hop library!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-20T17:26:48-08:00","id":15000,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ou-PXBovqyE\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ou-PXBovqyE\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ou-PXBovqyE </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ou-PXBovqyE\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ou-PXBovqyE </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> Surely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1247-maseiken","name":"Maseiken","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1247_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-21T21:39:50-08:00","id":15870,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackhatmatt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/12069-inspirational-music-for-demon?p=14730#post14730\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One of my favorite <b>Demon</b> songs: &quot;<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gH2efAcmBQM\" target=\"_blank\">Sail</a>&quot; by AWOLNATION.</div> </div> </div> </div>Holy crap the video is super appropriate to the tone of the game.<br /> My two entries: &quot;<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VztgtK-0Keo\" target=\"_blank\">Drones</a>&quot; By Rise Against<br /> and &quot;<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9-SQGOYOjxs\" target=\"_blank\">Prayer of the Refugee</a>&quot; By Rise Against","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/991-pgolasze13","name":"pgolasze13","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-22T09:26:27-08:00","id":16134,"title":"","content":"Ooh. I should listen to those again with my Demon ears on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/959-morkaischosen","name":"MorkaisChosen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"290"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-22T10:16:07-08:00","id":16156,"title":"","content":"7)<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S7zP8HVzCDA\" target=\"_blank\">Persona</a> by <a href=\"http://www.blueman.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Blue Man Group</a><br /> <br /> Demons wear a lot of faces. They have to, there are so many lies and scams they have to pull off just to survive, to keep what they've &quot;earned&quot;. But all of the pretending comes at price-every demon, most of the time, is going to bury the self same identity they Fell to get. <i>Persona</i> is brutal enough as a song about everyday people, but it's a lot darker and depressing when you consider it as a Demon song. It captures the ease and comfort of a Cover when you're going out-the song points out the utility of of disappearing with ease, and how in it's own weird way, it becomes a staple a demon an rely on, a constant to sort of find comfort. The problem, though, is that it never stops, and a demon will never find reprieve to comfortably be themselves. Even in their own homes, There's always some twist of words, some face, some string sentences forming yet another face over the same face she went to work in. In front of cultists, around demons, at work, under the noses of angels, a demon can only rarely show bits of themselves at a time. It's enough to make anyone scream, and maybe, underneath all the utility and talk of the Descent, that's why demons keep doing the cold war with the God Machine-because it provides opportunities, however damaging, to show themselves. Regardless, <i>Persona</i> is the song about the personal struggles of dealing with Cover, despite it being their greatest blessing.<br /> <br /> Noteworthy Mentions: <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nz1aRZFCcFs\" target=\"_blank\">The Complex, Shadows,</a> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eagbog8_MGI\" target=\"_blank\">Sing Along</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 11-22-2013, 03:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T12:16:52-08:00","id":17850,"title":"","content":"This is how a Wheel kills someone.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=\" data-code=\"CV85ToyUR2Q\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> 