3-08:00","id":17883,"title":"","content":"Also, Delain's <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0Q5XTBmi68M\" target=\"_blank\">Mother Machine</a>. If there is a song which just screams &quot;God Machine&quot;, I think that this is that one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T14:09:00-08:00","id":17920,"title":"","content":"Human After All by Daft Punk would fit great right at the end of a chronicle where the Demons finally get to just live their lives.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-26T08:57:19-08:00","id":18434,"title":"","content":"I like Within Temptation's &quot;What Have You Done?&quot; as a song about Falling.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WKtapZFSs7c\" data-code=\"WKtapZFSs7c\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/WKtapZFSs7c/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> Stabbing Westward's &quot;Shame&quot; is also great song for Demons and their interactions with Covers.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CsxaoXHe9Xc\" data-code=\"CsxaoXHe9Xc\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/CsxaoXHe9Xc/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />&quot;The true object of all human life is play. Earth is a task garden; heaven is a playground.&quot; -G.K. Chesterton","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/53-blackwingedheaven","name":"blackwingedheaven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar53_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-26T20:50:36-08:00","id":18923,"title":"","content":"I'd like to complain against Lostlight for listing one on my list(particularly since it's a high one), but to be honest it goes to those who go first. Besides, I'll talk more about it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-26T22:36:48-08:00","id":18959,"title":"","content":"I have to suggest The Protomen's second album. Nothing fits Demon quite so well as a passionate few fighting against the technological masses.<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Well, a friend once told me:</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Men, they would follow any man who would turn the wheels.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Now the wheels are spinning out of control; what would they do if we held them still?</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">If you destroy the working parts, what you'll get is a broken machine.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">A beacon of light from a burning screen.</span></span></span></i><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-26T22:40:56-08:00","id":18962,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:proxnov-reg\">I believe I can see the future<br /> 'Cause I repeat the same routine<br /> I think I used to have a purpose<br /> Then again, that might have been a dream</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:proxnov-reg\">I think I used to have a voice<br /> Now I never make a sound<br /> And I just do what I'm betold<br /> I really don't want them to come around, oh no</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:proxnov-reg\">Every day is exactly the same<br /> Every day is exactly the same<br /> <br /> In general NIN's With Teeth shares a lot of the themes I associate with Demon.</span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":737,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/737-campbell","user":"Campbell","date":". 11-27-2013, 01:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/737-campbell","name":"Campbell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar737_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-26T22:49:17-08:00","id":18965,"title":"","content":"Was listening to Stone Sour the other day and this came on &quot;<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AhiIZKaRixs\" target=\"_blank\">Tired</a>&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/991-pgolasze13","name":"pgolasze13","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-27T00:18:38-08:00","id":19000,"title":"","content":"I found two of my favourite Judas Priest songs pretty fitting, and the cover art for their 'Angel of Redemption' album is what I picture when I imagine a Destroyer in demonic form. All Guns Blazing (Going Loud Theme) Cross cutting thundercharge Blade of destruction Flame throwing hurricane Destroys the cage Bone crushing alien God of salvation Sad wings that heaven sent Wipes out in rage ALL GUNS ALL GUNS BLAZING Electric Eye (God Machine Theme) Up here in space I'm looking down on you. My lasers trace Everything you do. You think you've private lives? Think nothing of the kind. There is no true escape I'm watching all the time. I'm made of metal My circuits gleam. I am perpetual I keep the country clean.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1370-ormag\u00f6den","name":"Ormag\u00f6den","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-27T00:24:13-08:00","id":19004,"title":"","content":"So apparently this forum doesn't work so well with iThings. That wasn't a block of text when I hit enter, I can't edit the post because the field is blank, notifications have no text on the buttons, I can't set an avatar because click and drag doesn't work on touch-screens...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1370-ormag\u00f6den","name":"Ormag\u00f6den","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-27T15:27:22-08:00","id":19384,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YHHYgYEy-0M\" target=\"_blank\">Help, I'm alive, my heart keeps beating like a hammer.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/936-erichzahn","name":"ErichZahn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-27T19:01:57-08:00","id":19486,"title":"","content":"And now, thanks to the Random Demon Questions thread, two songs are popping into my mind for the contract aspect of Demon. The first is <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C7nmuEg2UdU\" target=\"_blank\">Poor Unfortunate Souls</a> from The Little Mermaid. The second is <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K4pStVNQc4M\" target=\"_blank\">Friends on the Other Side</a> from The Princess and the Frog.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;Seven deadly sins/Seven ways to win/Seven holy paths to hell/And your trip begins/Seven downward slopes/Seven bloodied hopes/Seven are your burning fires/Seven your desires&quot; \u2014 Iron Maiden,</i> Moonchild","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1122-the-grim-lich","name":"The Grim Lich","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-28T12:46:57-08:00","id":19861,"title":"","content":"Listened to the Rise Against tracks again. Shortly before doing so, I thought &quot;hmm, I think Drones might just be on because the chorus makes sense.&quot;<br /> <br /> And then I listened to it and realised <i>every line</i> has an obvious reading as from the point of view of a Fallen Angel of the God-Machine.<br /> <br /> Kudos. :-D","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/959-morkaischosen","name":"MorkaisChosen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"290"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-28T20:08:38-08:00","id":20040,"title":"","content":"6)<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XC2ywyxFXO4\" target=\"_blank\">Arise</a> by <a href=\"http://flyleafmusic.com/whoweare/\" target=\"_blank\">Flyleaf</a><br /> <br /> The Fall hurts. The angel who Falls has crashed, burned, and died, and now a new thing stands in it's place. A demon starts off as a broken thing that is, in many ways, right at the bottom of the barrel. It can be tempting to let it completely destroy them, but demons are what they are for a reason, and that thing is now worth living and fighting a cold war for. Say what you will, a demon's Descent is just another ascent from a different point of view, and that's why <i>Arise</i> is a song that works for them. World of Darkness games tend to have a strong, if sometimes illusory, core of hope, the idea, at least, that some things are possible or that some things will not fall, and Demon is no exception-the Descent is all about finding a reason to keep standing, to keep fighting. It's a dream worth living and dying for, worth bleeding and lying for, or at least they keep telling themselves. This entire song is not really a testament that they'll win, but it is a rallying cry that calls on common experiences and metaphors that demons draw on. It is a plea to keep on keeping on, full of hopeful power and desperate pleading. You don't believe the song because it's promises are realistic-no, they rather feel like the comforting lies you tell to your fellows. You believe it because someone else, the singer, wants to believe it so much that you get caught up in. It seems possible with so much emotion wrapped up in it. You have something you died for, something you fought the God Machine for, even if it was just in the form of a choice. You have the potential to be so much more than you were under the God Machine, if only you'll rise up and take it. Yeah, this song can apply pretty strongly to a variety of WoD characters, but given how brutally every angel falls, it seems most appropriate that every demon born in the inferno find their own song to <i>Arise</i> to.<br /> <br /> Noteworthy Mentions: I give credit to Flyleaf not calling themselves a Christian band, but they totally are-maybe more real than some others, but it's still what you would expect and it's still hard to make sit nicely with the iconography of Demon. What I'm saying is I'm not a fan. That said, these are, if not entertaining, at least solid pieces of Demon music, thematically speaking: <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A-Yik2STv1I\" target=\"_blank\">Believe in Dreams</a>, <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tj-hhY15U6s\" target=\"_blank\">Bittersweet</a>, <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jVJo1MldhQk\" target=\"_blank\">Fire Fire</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-28T20:45:16-08:00","id":20054,"title":"","content":"First off, I need to apologize. If it seems like I emphasize the fight against the God Machine and maybe not enough of the other aspects of Demon, there's two reasons for that. 1)Some themes are easier to find than others. I'm sure there are plenty of songs that emphasize the nature of a demon's casual life-in fact, I know at least two immeadiately, Devil by Stained and Rotten Inside by Earshot. Pacts, cults, covers, the way a demon feels, acts, so on, so forth-those songs exist, but it's not as populous as the &quot;Rebel Against God&quot;, at least from where I sit. 2)I'm also a sucker for rebellion, particularly against big, grand things like, I dunno, God, or the poseur thereof. I may not be a Saboteur, but I deeply sympathize, and wouldn't say no if that Agenda came knocking at my door for help. I suppose another factor is that a lot of these songs just fell straight into my lap, it was a quick construct of a top ten list, but whatever. That said, I do still stand by this list. With that said, possibly the most aggressive song on here:<br /> <br /> 5)<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=T6XlQhtqPQs\" target=\"_blank\">Anti-You</a> by <a href=\"http://www.bluestahli.com/site/\" target=\"_blank\">Blue Stahli</a><br /> <br /> For all the roots that the main enemy of Demon has in mythological and religious ideas(icons if nothing else), the God-Machine is a whole new being because of it's involvement in our technology and the culture that springs up around it. We rage against God quite a bit here, but many people are quick to note that we are raging against the Machine as well. So instead of going for an obligatory reference to some band that may or may not have gotten big with an earlier techgnostic revolution movie about a not-quite-occult-matrix or something, I'm gonna let Blue Stahli preach some heresy to the Church of Media with <i>Anti-You</i>. Without a doubt, it's still very techgnostic in it's feel, with it's evocation of religion in it's discussion about...well, everything, from advertisement to advertisement media to social networks, the dogma created by a manipulative corporate/government/both driven world and the quick-to-please masses. More so than any other New World game, Demon really gets into the heart of how the world is being played, tricked, deceived, and shuffled into place by it's own conceits, using that as the divine apparel for their steel and wi-fi god. <i>Anti-You</i> is vicious, painting the world that demons must contend with in perverse and cruel metaphor and turns of phrase before burning it all down. Really, the thing they attack is a nifty point-the million media lies are now so pervasive that it's almost impossible, if not flat out harmful, to remove from the world, much like the God-Machine, but demons can acknowledge that and still play counter to it all, despite the risks to their Cover-this song is the anthem of those going loud or those who skirt the edge of plausible Cover. It really captures, more so than anything else on this list, the new face of God that demons spit in. For every could be Integrator song on this list, <i>Anti You</i> raises the middle finger and tells the God Machine quite clearly where it can stick it.<br /> <br /> Noteworthy Mentions: <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owFJNeHmtHA\" target=\"_blank\">Ultranumb</a>, <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xFsYqDrTt8s\" target=\"_blank\">Corner</a>, <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=51k4FWnWqU8\" target=\"_blank\">Metamorphosis(Life Theory Remix)</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-28T21:02:04-08:00","id":20064,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MorkaisChosen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/12069-inspirational-music-for-demon?p=19861#post19861\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Listened to the Rise Against tracks again. Shortly before doing so, I thought &quot;hmm, I think Drones might just be on because the chorus makes sense.&quot;<br /> <br /> And then I listened to it and realised <i>every line</i> has an obvious reading as from the point of view of a Fallen Angel of the God-Machine.<br /> <br /> Kudos. :-D</div> </div> </div> </div>Haha thanks, Drones works better than Prayer of the Refugee, I feel.<br /> Next entry!<br /> &quot;<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LR_gcRp5v-k\" target=\"_blank\">A Demon's Fate</a>&quot; by Within Temptation<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/991-pgolasze13","name":"pgolasze13","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-07T20:53:42-08:00","id":25567,"title":"","content":"A friend of mine pointed me towards The Glitch Mob, after listening to a couple of their songs I got a definite Demon feel to them. I don't think anyone posted them so here are a couple.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kON_KRmFRKk\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kON_KRmFRKk\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kON_KRmFRKk\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kON_KRmFRKk </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=17PM-UMVud8\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=17PM-UMVud8\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=17PM-UMVud8\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=17PM-UMVud8 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Madness doesn't howl. Madness is that little voice in your head that speaks to you at the end of the day and asks, &quot;Is there room for one more?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/595-detective-jack-raines","name":"Detective Jack Raines","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar595_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-08T01:24:39-08:00","id":25670,"title":"","content":"Jack Raines: That's so freakin' random, I've never heard of Glitch Mob before tonight. I'm a DJ, and I got a request from some of the local hippie / electronica folks for some Glitch Mob. I definitely see how they could be fitting for a Demon theme.<br /> <br /> And, as a side note, &quot;Glitch Mob&quot; would be a fucking awesome name for a Ring / other-such-group of Demons.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1009-kristastic","name":"Kristastic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1009_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-08T13:33:40-08:00","id":26005,"title":"","content":"4)<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FWKO5cq-HvI\" target=\"_blank\"> Revolution Roulette</a> by <a href=\"http://www.poetsofthefall.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Poets of the Fall</a><br /> <br /> For all the lack of shock and awe that I, for some reason, can apply my favorite band to a new favorite game, it can't be ignored how iconic <i>Revolution Roulette</i> is of Demon. The entire song is about the God Machine, a highlight of why a demon would fall and how they would live under it and fight it. The best part is that this song isn't just about blatant defiance or hope-in fact neither come up. Rebellion, after all, <i>is </i>a gamble. When you Fall, you have no promise anything will work out-that's part of the reason why Integrators are sympathetic in this game, because they may be playing the safest game, and they're still probably screwed. You may be motivated to move and act, even just trying to live a normal life, but nothing about it really promises yields. If much of the rest of this playlist is about the ideals a demon might hold, this one still plays the game but is honest. The sounds are both dreary and powerful, with a strong beat to get the heart pumping and yet illustrate that you're in the heart of the enemy. This is the oppression of the Machine, the proof that there's no purgatory, no paradise, just the gamble.<br /> <br /> Noteworthy Mentions: <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f2-HOaIO7Wg\" target=\"_blank\">Dreaming Wide Awake</a>, <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0f_hewSrAH4\" target=\"_blank\">War</a>,<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eB097B218VI\" target=\"_blank\"> Delicious</a>, <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Bj2p_v_FfJ8\" target=\"_blank\">Where Do We Draw The Line</a>, <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vcjZZIRRBNA\" target=\"_blank\">You Know My Name</a>(original by Chris Cornell)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-09T09:47:07-08:00","id":26561,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZZjZex9pdDg\" target=\"_blank\">Boss of me now by There Might be Giants</a> This song embodies the spirit of freedom and rebellion found in demon.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LHgbzNHVg0c\" target=\"_blank\"> Many Moons by Janelle Monae</a> This song is depiction of an angle falling only to be quickly assimilated back into the Godmachine.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8EX6ye8wy2o\" target=\"_blank\"> Metropolis by Janelle Monae</a> This song is a longing for hell.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1544-vectorfox","name":"VectorFox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1544_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-09T10:44:20-08:00","id":26597,"title":"","content":"Within Temptation(all of there songs, but i'll give a few examples):<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2YN3yl3ur_I\" target=\"_blank\">Why not me(intro for your game, every time!!!!)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LR_gcRp5v-k\" target=\"_blank\">Demons fate.)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ve2pS-jxXz0\" target=\"_blank\">Fire and Ice( ...&quot;And I still wonder why haven has died...&quot;)</a><br /> <br /> Nighwish:<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p6xaIPszwpo\" target=\"_blank\">End of all hope.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GdZn7k5rZLQ\" target=\"_blank\">Amaranth!!</a><br /> <br /> Lacuna Coil:<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ixxtnrWb17Y\" target=\"_blank\">Havens a lie.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTT6picaCoQ\" target=\"_blank\">Trip to darkness</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1014-oh-goth","name":"Oh Goth...","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1014_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T12:34:03-08:00","id":28878,"title":"","content":"Hunted by Device<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3ahSS6XBeY0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3ahSS6XBeY0\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3ahSS6XBeY0 </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3ahSS6XBeY0\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3ahSS6XBeY0 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> &quot;Behold the new design<br /> Demonic worlds align<br /> A new beginning, a world that was frozen in time<br /> No thought of compromise<br /> The smell of blood, stirring emotion<br /> So darkly devoted, I have become...&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I...<br /> Have fallen once before tonight<br /> And I know... my<br /> Mistake won't be repeated&quot;<br /> <br /> Also from Device: <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rkhNpA7r_Sg\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rkhNpA7r_Sg</a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vE7sEX0zeeI\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vE7sEX0zeeI\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vE7sEX0zeeI </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vE7sEX0zeeI\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vE7sEX0zeeI </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dOGjMt_cmKo\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dOGjMt_cmKo\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dOGjMt_cmKo </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dOGjMt_cmKo\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dOGjMt_cmKo </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":405,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/405-ragecryx","user":"ragecryx","date":". 12-12-2013, 03:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/405-ragecryx","name":"ragecryx","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar405_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T16:55:13-08:00","id":43223,"title":"","content":"Because I'm not yet done and I have restored my faith in writing these, Let's get into the top three.<br /> <br /> 3)<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u3-IPG-XnaU\" target=\"_blank\">Darkangel</a> by <a href=\"http://www.anachronsounds.de/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\">VnV Nation</a><br /> <br /> This song is almost elementally Demon in ways few other songs are. The techno is powerful and steadily defiant with its' tempo. In fact, let's hone in on that word: Defiant. That's what this song is. The words aren't angry in delivery, but they are brimming with rebellion and disdain. This is the song that says &quot;No More&quot; for demons, the one that says something that needs to changes. It's a natural Saboteur song, but really it so captures every element of the Fall and the Descent in how it captures the need for the system to change that even Integrators can sympathize, even if it's only their defiance demands they be allowed to come back in. This song just describes Demon to a t, covering their entire lifespan and general motives. THe most powerful point, though, is how it comes back to people. The chorus is a testament to the person the singer is speaking to, the entire song a vow and explanation of their alien nature and the danger of their lives. This is the life of a Demon under the observation of a person(not from their perspective, just their observation). It's just-oh, man, how does this song not come with the game? With song playing and book in hand, <i>Darkangel</i> will take you to the darkened skies once more, and ever onward.<br /> <br /> Notable Mentions: <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kiaL1pHsd90\" target=\"_blank\">Control</a>, <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iOApdAhC3Tw\" target=\"_blank\">Rubicon</a>, <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kfc3zcnrWMQ\" target=\"_blank\">Beloved</a>, and even if it's a Changeling song really, <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZGuGiezVzXE\" target=\"_blank\">Illusion</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 01-05-2014, 08:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T17:18:24-08:00","id":43235,"title":"","content":"2)<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0nqiMIu91Fo\" target=\"_blank\">Annie, Would I Lie To You</a> by <a href=\"http://www.irismusic.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Iris</a><br /> <br /> Nope, I take it back-THIS SONG is Demon, elementally. Or rather, this is the opposite number. If Darkangel is the quintessential song for fighting the God Machine, then <i>Annie, Would I Lie</i> To You is the quintessential song for dealing with humanity, in its' most heartbreaking form. Demons are damn good liars, tricksters, and schemers-but they can't wholly escape the questions that will arise if they do anything outside of maintaining their cover, and even then. They need their covers to stay alive, but there's no denying just how their lies will hurt other people. From simply taking jobs or hair colors, small things that never the less define the person in the moment to so many to actually wearing their face, a Demon living is nothing but velvet pain for others. How do you justify the changes? How do you excuse the way you slip off? How do you keep people from seeing the worst? You never really can-all you can do is lie to them and pray you can get them to trust you. The simplest way to go about this song is to listen to it twice. First time around, imagine yourself as the demon,and the circumstances that would provoke you to say these things-hell, some of it can be because of the person you're telling it to! Second time around, just be Annie, and see how you'd feel if you were told to this. Imagine what it would look like to you. This is Demon, one part cold war, one part human drama. It hurts so much, both you and them, but if you want any kind of a happy ending, at some point you're going to have to ask people the horrible question &quot;<i>[Annie], Would I Lie To You?</i>&quot;.<br /> <br /> Noteworthy Mentions: <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fUIuUVFaymk\" target=\"_blank\">Endless</a>, <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xF_OUncVXjk\" target=\"_blank\">Twilight</a>, <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mSfAdY5oVK8\" target=\"_blank\">Saving Time</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-06T03:04:17-08:00","id":43412,"title":"","content":"I'm quite surprised that Metric haven't made it onto any of these lists. I don't know if it was the fact that they toured here a few weeks before Christmas which just so happened to coincide with when my mates first got me into Demon, but I've noticed several of their song's with one in particular seeming to fit perfectly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Some day we'll look back on this, laugh awkwardly and change the subject.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1889-thefrigidmidget","name":"TheFrigidMidget","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1889_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-06T03:11:08-08:00","id":43417,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=spqgpkobEh4\" target=\"_blank\">Blindness </a>is my top pick from Metric. Pretty much could tell the story of an Angel pre and post fall. Themes of blind servitude giving way to freedom and breaking free from what one has been brought up with. Plus the line &quot;All the survivors singing in the rain&quot; instantly reminds me of the Seattle setting (my limited understanding is it rains there pretty much the whole time?).<br /> <br /> Send us a blindfold, send us a blade<br /> Tell the survivors help is on the way<br /> I was a blind fool, never complained<br /> All the survivors singing in the rain<br /> I was the one with the world at my feet<br /> Got us a battle, leave it up to me<br /> <br /> Find us a trap door, find us a plane<br /> Tell the survivors help is on the way<br /> I was a blind fool, never complained<br /> All the survivors singing in the rain<br /> I was the one with the world at my feet<br /> Got us a battle, leave it up to me<br /> <br /> What it is and where it stops nobody knows<br /> You gave me a life I never chose<br /> I wanna leave but the world won't let me go<br /> Wanna leave but the world won't let me go<br /> <br /> I was the one with the world at my feet<br /> Got us a battle, leave it up to me<br /> Leave it up to me","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Some day we'll look back on this, laugh awkwardly and change the subject.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1889-thefrigidmidget","name":"TheFrigidMidget","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1889_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-06T03:34:54-08:00","id":43424,"title":"","content":"Then we've got <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PZuLsz4yPPM\" target=\"_blank\">Breathing Underwater</a> from Metric as well. Pretty much sounds like a newly fallen Demon making it's way in the world while coming to terms with it's new existence.<br /> <br /> I'm the blade<br /> You're a life<br /> I'm the weight<br /> You're the kite<br /> They were right when they said<br /> We were breathing underwater<br /> Out of place all the time<br /> In a world that wasn't mine to take<br /> <br /> I'll wait<br /> Is this my life? Ahhh<br /> Am I breathing underwater?<br /> Is this my life? Ahhh<br /> Am I breathing underwater?<br /> <br /> I'm the blade<br /> You're a life<br /> I'm the weight<br /> You're the kite<br /> They were right when they said we should never meet our heroes<br /> When they bowed at their feet, in the end it wasn't me<br /> <br /> Is this my life? Ahhh<br /> Am I breathing underwater?<br /> Is this my life? Ahhh<br /> Am I breathing underwater?<br /> <br /> Nights are days<br /> We'll beat a path through the mirrored maze<br /> I can see the end<br /> But it hasn't happened yet<br /> I can see the end<br /> But it hasn't happened yet<br /> <br /> Is this my life? Ahhh<br /> Am I breathing underwater?<br /> Is this my life? Ahhh<br /> Am I breathing underwater?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Some day we'll look back on this, laugh awkwardly and change the subject.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1889-thefrigidmidget","name":"TheFrigidMidget","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1889_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-07T15:16:51-08:00","id":44471,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>theye1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/12069-inspirational-music-for-demon?p=13172#post13172\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Golden earring - Twilight zone</div> </div> </div> </div>Not a bad choice!<br /> <br /> I think I'd do a fairly broad range of music. Grunge is almost mandatory, but you have to go with the right style. I think Alice in Chains was the best group to come out of the Seattle grunge scene by a large margin, and a lot of their tunes could work. In addition to being one of my favorite songs ever, the beat and grind of <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Opzq-hxYgfE\" target=\"_blank\">Man in the Box</a> and its weirdness works for <b>Demon</b>. Also recommend <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8aoJdq8ZFYE\" target=\"_blank\">Heaven Beside You</a>, and <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PSJ3sdcO33s\" target=\"_blank\">Would</a> is especially good.<br /> <br /> Also, I'd mix in heavy alternating doses of industrial (I get the feeling Slipknot would feature in there a lot, too), maybe some particularly haunting techno (dance floor stuff won't work unless you're in that kind of scene), and some stuff like Def Tones, maybe some Rage, Static X, Mudvayne, etc., as long as it works. I'm not sure if Waterproof Blonde's other stuff is any good or not, which I should really find out, but I really like <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iDXneKUiN1s\" target=\"_blank\">Just Close Your Eyes</a> by that group. Even works perfectly for <b>Demon</b>, with the lyrics.<br /> <br /> <i>Deceived by my eyes<br /> And all I was told I should see<br /> Opinions not mine<br /> The person they taught me to be<br /> One night in the dark<br /> A vision of someone I knew<br /> And in the darkness I saw<br /> A voice say 'I'm you'<br /> Inside me, a light was turned on<br /> Then I was alive<br /> <br /> If you close your eyes<br /> Your life, a naked truth revealed<br /> Dreams you never lived and scars never healed<br /> In the darkness light will take you to the other side<br /> And find me waiting there, you'll see<br /> If you just close your eyes</i><br /> <br /> <br /> And abuse the Hell out of Silent Hill soundtracks. Seriously, for ambient music (and occasionally those with lyrics, you could use Mary McGlynn's SH stuff), that stuff is <i>perfect </i>for <b>Demon: The Descent</b>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":109,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","user":"Claire Redfield","date":". 01-07-2014, 06:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-07T19:46:18-08:00","id":44620,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hawthorn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/12069-inspirational-music-for-demon?p=12110#post12110\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It probably goes without saying but...<br /> <br /> This theme for the God Machine -<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iwtO7uspNG4\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iwtO7uspNG4\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iwtO7uspNG4\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iwtO7uspNG4 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> This one for the Hunter Angels -<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cj5si_HJFcI\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cj5si_HJFcI\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cj5si_HJFcI\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cj5si_HJFcI </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> This one for other Demons -<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Uh10VTN_Kvw\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Uh10VTN_Kvw\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Uh10VTN_Kvw\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Uh10VTN_Kvw </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The music for the show is awesome in general. I just really like the idea of the general theme for Demon's being an altered version of the God Machine theme.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hearing this stuff made me think of the Bourne Identity soundtrack. I do think the brooding nature of the music would well alongside these cuts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s779tB2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1941-beornovursee","name":"BeornOvursee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1941_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T03:06:13-08:00","id":45470,"title":"","content":"More Alice in Chains goodness: <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PF_sGFjQYow\" target=\"_blank\">Voices</a><br /> <br /> Check out that video, too. Works great for <b>Demon</b>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T18:50:19-08:00","id":45985,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Claire Redfield</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/12069-inspirational-music-for-demon?p=45470#post45470\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">More Alice in Chains goodness: <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PF_sGFjQYow\" target=\"_blank\">Voices</a><br /> <br /> Check out that video, too. Works great for <b>Demon</b>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nice choice. I have added it to my playlist","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s779tB2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1941-beornovursee","name":"BeornOvursee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1941_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T12:04:20-08:00","id":55597,"title":"","content":"Of particular note for me lately has been Tool's &quot;Schism&quot;.<br /> <br /> Particularly the lines, &quot;No fault, none to blame, it doesn't mean I don't desire to point the finger, blame the other, watch the temple topple over.&quot;<br /> <br /> Runner up in my Tool library is, &quot;Vicarious&quot;. Though, I admit, that's a carry-over from my oWoD list.<br /> <br /> &quot;Radioactive&quot; by Imagine Dragons.<br /> &quot;The Fear&quot;, by Lily Allen, another throwback from my oWoD playlist.<br /> <br /> Meatloaf's, &quot;The Monster is Loose&quot;, &quot;In the land of the Pig, the Butcher is king&quot; and for the Saboteur in all of us, &quot;If it ain't broke, break it&quot;.<br /> Metallica's, &quot;The God that Failed&quot; and for the Tempters, &quot;The Judas Kiss&quot;. &quot;Prince Charming&quot; is also good for the Chaos/Cacophony types.<br /> <br /> &quot;I never told you what I do for a living&quot;, by My Chemical Romance, for my Destroyer. <br /> Oh, and, &quot;The Noose&quot;, by A Perfect Circle, for my Destroyer as well.<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Recall the deeds as if they're all someone else's atrocious stories; now, you stand reborn before us all. So glad to see you well.&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2074-64bitjedi","name":"64bitjedi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-25T21:02:11-08:00","id":57883,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BmErRm-vApI\" target=\"_blank\">Say Something (I'm Giving Up On You) - By A Great Big World</a> for Integrators.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":1642,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","user":"Paddon","date":". 01-26-2014, 12:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-25T21:03:47-08:00","id":57885,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SGwIhNLo-cs\" target=\"_blank\">Uprising (by Muse)</a> for Saboteurs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-31T06:10:22-08:00","id":62122,"title":"","content":"Breed 77's <a href=\"http://http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VCdelMeG9Aw\" target=\"_blank\">Alive.</a><br /> <br /> The chorus has a big chunk of the duality of demonic existence - hating the God-Machine's influence but needing to be near it for the things that keep you alive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/959-morkaischosen","name":"MorkaisChosen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"290"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T11:14:50-08:00","id":63017,"title":"","content":"Alright, time for the finale and the final list. And really, you should have known this was coming.<br /> <br /> 1) <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?feature=player_detailpage&amp;v=Dy6MpsDPKts\" target=\"_blank\">Paradise(What About Us?)</a> by <a href=\"http://www.within-temptation.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Within Temptation</a><br /> <br /> I never doubted for a second that this song was a Demon song. I first heard a sample before Demon's kickstarter was even made, and I knew this was the theme song of Demon. And then the song came out, and I was convinced that this song was the Descent, and then Descent came out and that just confirmed it. This song is just about everything you can expect from the game. It's the regret of the Fall, the rage against the Machine, the fear of other demons, the desperate longing for Hell(Paradise), the resolution to make something in this life, the alienation of humanity, and more. In short, this song is the wrecking and desperate search and fight for faith, for that thing that any given demon can believe in when all else betrays them. With burning, hard metal moving the piece, sweeping symphonic swells tossing the listener through the experience, angelic choirs pulling at you and operatic vocals laying bare the soul of this song, it captures the heart and soul of Demon the Descent as much it does the form and life of it's characters. From Fall to God Machine to Hell, this song just captures Demon with every note and line. Whatever a demon goes for, they always have something to fight for, even though it's not <i>Paradise</i>.<br /> <br /> Noteworthy Mentions: <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?feature=player_detailpage&amp;v=x6vK9kMwEkc\" target=\"_blank\">A Demon's Fate</a>, <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?feature=player_detailpage&amp;v=35RqzSR5Who\" target=\"_blank\">Stairway to the Skies</a>, <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1qP22G2PJKQ\" target=\"_blank\">Where Is The Edge</a>, <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ve2pS-jxXz0\" target=\"_blank\">Fire and Ice</a>, <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VK9qfVQ4Z04\" target=\"_blank\">Angels</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T11:31:02-08:00","id":63024,"title":"","content":"And now so you aren't scrambling all over the place for the list if you just want music, a compilation of my top ten.<br /> <br /> 1) <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?feature=player_detailpage&amp;v=Dy6MpsDPKts\" target=\"_blank\">Paradise(What About Us?)</a>by <a href=\"http://www.within-temptation.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Within Temptation</a><br /> 2) <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0nqiMIu91Fo\" target=\"_blank\">Annie, Would I Lie To You</a> by <a href=\"http://www.irismusic.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Iris</a><br /> 3) <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u3-IPG-XnaU\" target=\"_blank\">Darkangel</a> by <a href=\"http://www.anachronsounds.de/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\">VnV Nation</a><br /> 4)<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FWKO5cq-HvI\" target=\"_blank\"> Revolution Roulette</a> by <a href=\"http://www.poetsofthefall.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Poets of the Fall</a><br /> 5) <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=T6XlQhtqPQs\" target=\"_blank\">Anti-You</a> by <a href=\"http://www.bluestahli.com/site/\" target=\"_blank\">Blue Stahli</a><br /> 6) <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XC2ywyxFXO4\" target=\"_blank\">Arise</a> by <a href=\"http://flyleafmusic.com/whoweare/\" target=\"_blank\">Flyleaf</a><br /> 7) <a href=\"http://www