omine</b>. Mixing German biblical referancess with latin lyrics, is just pure gold for Demon. Here you got a small taste:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://youtu.be/Qq85G-EdFEI\" target=\"_blank\"><b>E Nomine - Vater Unser</b></a><br /> <br /> I use this dark electronic for combats. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-22-2014, 06:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-03T20:09:22-08:00","id":83712,"title":"","content":"Damn do I love Metric. Nine Inch Nails and Tool are also great for Demon.<br /> No mention of <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wuK0f-Zur9A&amp;index=4&amp;list=LLPUopg2lXZ46AmkFgS6c05w\" target=\"_blank\">Mother by Danzig?</a><br /> If you wanna find hell with me ^^","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1S8EuNtxeJKwq4sKVVPe16_N0ylIashKpgfCCuA1UOM8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Promethean Homebrew.</a><br /> <br /> Yes, I made it the same way as a Promethean. No, the authorities haven't found me yet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/685-ben-quo","name":"Ben Quo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar685_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-03T20:32:42-08:00","id":83724,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/12069-inspirational-music-for-demon?p=76954#post76954\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">At least half of songs from German project <b>E Nomine</b>. Mixing German biblical referancess with latin lyrics, is just pure gold for Demon. Here you got a small taste:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://youtu.be/Qq85G-EdFEI\" target=\"_blank\"><b>E Nomine - Vater Unser</b></a><br /> <br /> I use this dark electronic for combats. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Youtube is acting nutty for me, so I'm gonna request someone find the natural opposite of this from E Nomine-Lucifer.<br /> <br /> Das Omen, Das Tier En Mir, and Mitternacht are all really awesome too. I went back to those late because I wanted techgnostic-y sounding songs(hence why they aren't on my Top Ten), but if you can go wrong with E Nomine I've yet to see it done.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-03T23:59:18-08:00","id":83821,"title":"","content":"A few that spring to the forefront:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BKcy-LiAFWU\" target=\"_blank\">Rinzler - Daft Punk (Kaskade Remix from the R3CONF1GUR3D Album)</a> - Brings to mind what a confrontation with Hunter Angels might be like, especially with liberal use of the Demonic Form. Bit clubbish at times, but the first 1.5 minutes are especially evocative.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xgzbyd2MhbE\" target=\"_blank\">Ozar Midrashim - Information Society</a> - Some might know this as part of the Legacy of Kain series, but the original with the opening spoken part should not be overlooked. Information Society has a few others, but I prefer this as a standout. YMMV.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YsLZp14uz2M\" target=\"_blank\">Zeal Feels Good - OC ReMix</a> - Techno-Inquisitor fuel.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=plsUE4YiQK0\" target=\"_blank\">Saladin - Harry Gregson Williams (Hybrid Remix)</a> - Can't put my finger on it, but this song brings to mind infiltrating Infrastructure.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2059-jotun","name":"Jotun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2059_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T14:24:55-07:00","id":90422,"title":"","content":"Phantoms - I Became Operational<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/phantomsla/i-became-operational-original\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container