QohZXA8wvIA </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;The Angry River&quot; by The Hat</span></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:proxnov-reg\">The emptiness that we confess<br /> In the dimmest hour of day<br /> In Automatown they make a sound<br /> Like the low sad moan of prey</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:proxnov-reg\">The bitter taste the hidden face<br /> Of the lost forgotten child<br /> The darkest need the slowest speed<br /> The debt unreconciled</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:proxnov-reg\">These photographs mean nothing<br /> To the poison that they take<br /> Before a moment's glory<br /> The light begins to fade</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:proxnov-reg\">The awful cost of all we lost<br /> As we looked the other way<br /> We've paid the price of this cruel device<br /> Till we've nothing left to pay</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:proxnov-reg\">The river goes where the current flows<br /> The light we must destroy<br /> Events conspire to set afire<br /> The methods we employ</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:proxnov-reg\">These dead men walk on water<br /> Cold blood runs through their veins<br /> The angry river rises<br /> As we step into the rain</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:proxnov-reg\">These photographs mean nothing<br /> To the poison that they take<br /> The angry river rises<br /> As we step into the rain</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Assistant Organizer for:</b><br /> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i162.phot