acy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/979249-2e-legacy-update-choir-of-hashmallim-with-bonus-content-about-summoning\" target=\"_blank\">Choir of Hashmallim</a> (plus extra Summoning content)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/980550-2e-legacy-update-storm-keepers\" target=\"_blank\">Storm Keepers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu","name":"Caladriu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1048"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-27T20:30:25-07:00","id":210770,"title":"","content":"I'm developing a new list of demo nsongs that might deserve a discussion approach, and this might be one, but in the mean time: enjoy a a more emotional approach to an angel whose choir mates are on the edge of the Fall that might drag them along with it.<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UjZqcDYbvAE\" data-code=\"UjZqcDYbvAE\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/UjZqcDYbvAE/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 07-27-2014, 11:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-01T00:36:20-07:00","id":245932,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">I've said it before, and I'll say it again; <i>The Protomen</i> are perfect for <i>Demon</i>. They're a rock opera group with a very 80s feel and their music is loosely inspired by Mega Man. The album worth listening to (<i>Act II: The Father of Death</i>) is about a pair of men who create robots in order to make the world a better place. One of them goes mad with power and creates an oppressive dystopia, the other is forced underground and gets shit on repeatedly. The recurring antagonist in Act 2 is a terrifying robot called Sniper that feels like great Angel inspiration, and the whole album is hot-blooded enough to feel like a collection of Saboteur anthems.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8R8MkEsgf-I\" target=\"_blank\">Link to one of the better songs.</a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\">I will not be told where to stand!</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">I will not be told what to say.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">Not by man or machine,</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">Not by you, not by anyone tonight!</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">You're gonna have to do better than fear</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">You're gonna have to step out of the shadows and fight!</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">And when they see your face again,</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">They will know what it means</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">to have fear dragged out into the light.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">Drag it out!</span></i> </div> </div> </div></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-05T21:58:44-07:00","id":250489,"title":"","content":"Has anyone mentioned the entire Portal 2 soundtrack? No? Good.<br /> <br /> <i>The entire Portal 2 Soundtrack.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-06T09:38:21-07:00","id":250816,"title":"","content":"I see no one has mentioned &quot;<a href=\"https://ww